  "description": "CR 602.2 / 701.21a / 712.11a / 715.3a / 715.3c / 715.2b / 701.53a / 613.4c / 701.8a / 611.2c: Elesh Norn sacrifices three other creatures to return transformed as The Argent Etchings, which incubates 2 five times and transforms them, gives your creatures +1/+1 and double strike for a turn, then destroys every other permanent but artifacts, lands and Phyrexians and returns front face up",
  "note": "Elesh Norn is refused as one of its own three; Memnite is a fourth creature keeping the choice real. Chapter I's five Incubators all become 2/2 Phyrexians. Chapter II reaches Memnite (1/1, not Phyrexian) but not bob's Grizzly Bears, and ends at end of turn. Chapter III destroys bob's Bears and carol's Pacifism (an enchantment) but spares Memnite (an artifact), bob's Mind Stone, his Phyrexian Rager (a Phyrexian, not an artifact), carol's Forest and the Phyrexian tokens, then exiles the Saga and returns Elesh Norn.",
